    <artifactId>inspecto-insights</artifactId>
    <packaging>jar</packaging>

    <name>Inspecto — Business Insights (optional)</name>
    <description>
        OPTIONAL add-on module (BI-INSIGHTS-1, D-BI2; every edition since D-BI13): the "Business Insights" add-on. P2 ships "Explain this
        change" (POST /insights/explain: I-4 drivers, I-5 mix vs rate, I-6 moved with it) through ExplainRoutes; P3 adds
        Insight Profiles and the insight.scan Job here. Package com.gamma.insights. The statistics live in the Analytics
        Kernel (com.gamma.analytics.drivers); every statement runs through the core's BiSpecRunner, the same guard,
        sandbox and masking as POST /bi/query.

        Contributed through the core's public seam com.gamma.spi.http.RouteModule (feature id "insights"). Bundled from
        the Standard edition up; on Basic the core answers /insights/explain with 503 "not installed" (from module.toon).
        THIN: no shade, no sidecar classifier. Built only under the edition profiles.
    </description>

